cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: If you use this app, please cite it and the works it builds on, listed under references.
type: software
title: diffcyt Differential Abundance & State
abstract: Tests which FlowSOM metaclusters change in frequency (differential abundance) and which cluster-marker
  pairs change in expression (differential state) between conditions with diffcyt, following the CyTOF
  workflow of Nowicka et al. Writes result tables, volcano and proportion plots, heatmaps and JSON summaries.
authors:
- name: Pennsieve (University of Pennsylvania)
repository-code: https://github.com/pennsieve-apps/processor-diffcyt
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
- cytometry
- flow-cytometry
- immunology
- differential-abundance
- differential-state
- statistics
- diffcyt
